    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478120/extras/21fe5f605f1b019bf299435d3d49a642.avif?t=1741591280\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help cats get to sleep in this adorable game, with novel mechanics based on nonograms and sliding puzzles. Nekograms is easy to learn but does get challenging!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478120/extras/aa20dfe13966a93df44040b6ce7632fd.webp?t=1741591280\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cats only sleep on cushions. Complete a level by helping all cats get to sleep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478120/extras/b7cd1d1b04d959a80f9a9f0df5dde084.poster.avif?t=1741591280\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478120/extras/b7cd1d1b04d959a80f9a9f0df5dde084.webm?t=1741591280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478120/extras/b7cd1d1b04d959a80f9a9f0df5dde084.mp4?t=1741591280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478120/extras/5b148442477651f49682b6a6806bf8d4.webp?t=1741591280\" /></span>Earn stars by completing levels in the fewest number of moves. Achieve 3 stars in every level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478120/extras/55e27e0b1822c7b015de07909e231e35.poster.avif?t=1741591280\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478120/extras/55e27e0b1822c7b015de07909e231e35.webm?t=1741591280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478120/extras/55e27e0b1822c7b015de07909e231e35.mp4?t=1741591280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478120/extras/99ae1b4973bc140c4bad788aaba59b9c.webp?t=1741591280\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the game to unlock Endless Mode and ascend through different states of cat consciousness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478120/extras/566edbc642e8e399cf28b4ae94f1416b.poster.avif?t=1741591280\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478120/extras/566edbc642e8e399cf28b4ae94f1416b.webm?t=1741591280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478120/extras/566edbc642e8e399cf28b4ae94f1416b.mp4?t=1741591280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478120/extras/e69e4acd62a86c04a7c3d31f5cd15442.webp?t=1741591280\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original puzzle mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >120 levels over 3 unique worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 15 different cat breeds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478120/extras/6342ffc22b0a1dd1439afccb6ce083cc.avif?t=1741591280\" /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478120/extras/21fe5f605f1b019bf299435d3d49a642.avif?t=1741591280\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help cats get to sleep in this adorable game, with novel mechanics based on nonograms and sliding puzzles. Nekograms is easy to learn but does get challenging!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478120/extras/aa20dfe13966a93df44040b6ce7632fd.webp?t=1741591280\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cats only sleep on cushions. Complete a level by helping all cats get to sleep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478120/extras/b7cd1d1b04d959a80f9a9f0df5dde084.poster.avif?t=1741591280\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478120/extras/b7cd1d1b04d959a80f9a9f0df5dde084.webm?t=1741591280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478120/extras/b7cd1d1b04d959a80f9a9f0df5dde084.mp4?t=1741591280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478120/extras/5b148442477651f49682b6a6806bf8d4.webp?t=1741591280\" /></span>Earn stars by completing levels in the fewest number of moves. Achieve 3 stars in every level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478120/extras/55e27e0b1822c7b015de07909e231e35.poster.avif?t=1741591280\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478120/extras/55e27e0b1822c7b015de07909e231e35.webm?t=1741591280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478120/extras/55e27e0b1822c7b015de07909e231e35.mp4?t=1741591280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478120/extras/99ae1b4973bc140c4bad788aaba59b9c.webp?t=1741591280\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the game to unlock Endless Mode and ascend through different states of cat consciousness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478120/extras/566edbc642e8e399cf28b4ae94f1416b.poster.avif?t=1741591280\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478120/extras/566edbc642e8e399cf28b4ae94f1416b.webm?t=1741591280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478120/extras/566edbc642e8e399cf28b4ae94f1416b.mp4?t=1741591280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478120/extras/e69e4acd62a86c04a7c3d31f5cd15442.webp?t=1741591280\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original puzzle mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >120 levels over 3 unique worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 15 different cat breeds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478120/extras/6342ffc22b0a1dd1439afccb6ce083cc.avif?t=1741591280\" /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Help cats get to sleep in this adorable puzzle game! Move the cats and cushions so that every kitty is nice and comfy. But there\u2019s a twist! Cats only move left and right, and cushions only move up and down.",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Vietnamese, Indonesian",
    "reviews": "\u201cIf you love a good puzzle game to pass the time that also happens to include a colourful cast of funny little felines, then Nekograms will be the game for you. \u2013Ruby Innes\u201d<br>Kotaku<br><br>\u201cIt\u2019s good. It\u2019s puzzles. It\u2019s cats. It\u2019s perfect. \u2013Grace Hester\u201d<br>goto game<br><br>\u201cThere are times when a simple premise is applied so well, something special happens: a game that is just inherently amusing. \u2013Tony Cocking\u201d<br>Twinfinite<br>",
